OL,3,AFatbergs, feathers and flocks of sheep 
OL,4,A- inside the new London Museum         
OL,6,FTen years ago the Museum of London     
OL,7,Fannounced it would be leaving its      
OL,8,Fformer home to move to the abandoned   
OL,9,Fhalls of Smithfield Market. Now        
OL,10,Frebranded London Museum, it is set to  
OL,11,Fopen its doors to the public on        
OL,12,FSaturday after a #437m project. So     
OL,13,Fwhat's it like inside?                 
OL,15,FLeaning back on a leather sofa, museum 
OL,16,Fdirector Sharon Ament looks across a   
OL,17,Fvast brick-lined space that once       
OL,18,Fbustled with market traders but is now 
OL,19,Ffilling with its newest visitors.      
